			"notes": "In general, I made changes that are helpful for me, and for anyone using this mod!\nI want to say before the patch notes, that I'm so thankful for all of the support across modrinth and curseforge (and even github!).\n\n## Changes from last release\n- No longer refreshes resource packs unnecessarily\n- Selecting a preset now saves the whole page\n- When new features are added, the default value is selected instead of blank.\n## Dev changes from last release\n- Refactored the entire Config.java class"
		},
