			"notes": "## Changes from last Modrinth / Curseforge release:\n- No longer blankly adds 64 to y value, and instead adds based on the minimum Y level of the world you're in. Meaning it wont add 64 to the nether or on 1.16- crossplay servers\n- There is no default title anymore, before it was Minecraft\n## Changes from last github release:\n- Zoom distance now defaults to 4 instead of 0\n- Server sided Opt-In to flying with ghost blocks\n- Experimental Tab Removed\n- Some text is re-ordered"
		},
