			"notes": "**Changes:**\n- 1.19.3 Support\n-  Added the ability to not let you mine if your pickaxe's durability is below a certain percentage.\n- Upgrade to cloth config v9\n- Death screen now uses advanced calculations (Random.nextInt) to tell you how many zeptoseconds you contributed to the heat death of the universe\n- Added server roulette button to Direct connect screen, which picks a random ip and attempts a connection\n- (internal) refactored the setting to disable negative numbers in f3\n\nNo forge build this time, because i do not like working with forge all that much to be honest, and i don't think anybody will miss it. It will be included in the next update if I get bothered enough by it"
		},
